      "setId": "set-role-marker",
      "problem": "A spy does not hold an alias the way an operative holds a cyanide pill: one is an abstract concealment, the other a physical possession, so the pairs are not at the same grain.",
      "source": "both",
      "candidates": [
        "The editor's own: keep the concealment reading and pair it consistently \u2014 spy : alias :: gun : holster, where each uses the other to stay hidden.",
        "Keep the possession reading and make both physical \u2014 operative : cyanide pill :: courier : sealed pouch.",
        "Drop the set and promote another graded candidate, since spy and operative are near-synonyms and weaken the analogy regardless."
      ]
    }
